lens around it sort of

00:22:12.297 --> 00:22:13.732
in a public sense.

00:22:13.732 --> 00:22:16.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, I am just so, truly,
I'm so proud of you.

00:22:16.201 --> 00:22:17.803
It's like, that's what I
feel when I'm with you.

00:22:17.803 --> 00:22:20.605
I feel like you're
doing something real.

00:22:20.605 --> 00:22:21.873
And so many people
that I've come across

00:22:21.873 --> 00:22:23.141
and they say, "It's not real.

00:22:23.141 --> 00:22:24.943
It's fake, or it's confused,

00:22:24.943 --> 00:22:26.678
or it's muddled, or something."

00:22:26.678 --> 00:22:28.146
And you're the real deal.

00:22:28.146 --> 00:22:29.681
- [Candace] Thank you.

00:22:29.681 --> 00:22:31.116
