00:22:32.451 --> 00:22:33.385
Can you give me credit for that?

00:22:33.385 --> 00:22:34.619
- And you love chicken parm!

00:22:34.619 --> 00:22:36.021
That's something people
don't know about you,

00:22:36.021 --> 00:22:37.823 align:start size:97% position:3%
you love a good chicken parm.
- I love all chicken.

00:22:37.823 --> 00:22:39.458
That's why I want
chickens, actually.

